cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "LabRAG: cited answers from a lab's paper collection"
abstract: >-
  LabRAG indexes the documents in a research lab's shared folders (a NAS share and/or a
  Google Drive folder) into a single SQLite file combining full-text and vector search, and
  answers natural-language questions with passages cited by paper and page. It is the
  successor to SHARK RAG, rebuilt so that one machine serves the whole lab through a web
  page and lab members install nothing.
type: software
